flowchart LR
  C[Client request] --> A[FastAPI router]
  A --> AUTH[Auth / session]
  AUTH --> H[Domain handler]

  H -->|read/write| PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  H -->|cache get/set| RD[(Redis)]
  H -->|enqueue| Q[RQ queue]

  H -->|aggregate| SUP[Supplier APIs]
  SUP --> H

  H --> R[JSON response]
  R --> C

  Q --> W[Worker]
  W --> PG
  W --> RD
